comments.message:
Hello! I've been playing around with the plugin and seems promising. But found two issues, would like to know if its me that can't make it work or cases are not supported yet. 

1.- Can't get to work two levels of nested variables on import 
eg. 
CollectionPrimitive/Colors/Red=#ff0000; 
CollectionSemantics/Colors/Error="PrimitiveColorsRed"; 
CollectionComponents/Button/StateError="SemanticsColorsError";
--- In this scenario ButtonSateError is not even appearing on import (after several trials my guessing is lack of support of two levels of nested variables, but wanted to confirm if this is true). 

2.- [collectionName] attribute is not included on export
making that nested variables are not automatically appearing on import (need to manually add this attribute to the exported json).

